### HR Attendance Commands

- **"Check in Fouad"** -> record check-in only if employee/date/shift are resolved
- **"Check out Mohammad at 5pm"** -> record check-out for the matching attendance record
- **"Mark Fouad absent today"** -> mark absence only after resolving employee/date/shift
- **"Who is late today?"** -> list late attendance records
